---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="First Hour in Qingdao — Airport Arrival Guide" description="Your first hour in Qingdao, step by step: immigration forms, buying a SIM card, setting up Alipay, Didi vs taxi lines, and getting to your hotel." pageType="Article">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="tag mb-3">Survival Guide</p>
      <h1 class="mb-2">Your First Hour in Qingdao</h1>
      <p class="body-lg mb-10 max-w-[65ch]">You just landed at Qingdao Jiaodong International Airport (TAO). What now? Here is exactly what happens, step by step, with all the things nobody tells you beforehand.</p>

      <!-- Step timeline -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 mb-16">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Immigration (10-30 min)</h2>
              <div class="body space-y-2">
                <p>Queue at the Foreigners channel. Have these ready:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
                  <li>Passport with valid Chinese visa (or 240-hour visa-free transit eligibility)</li>
                  <li>Completed Arrival Card (handed out on the plane, fill it with a pen BEFORE landing)</li>
                  <li>Hotel booking confirmation (they rarely ask but have it on your phone)</li>
                  <li>Return/onward flight ticket (they frequently ask for this)</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--color-accent)] font-medium">Tip: Write your hotel name and address in Chinese on a note. The officer may ask where you are staying.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Baggage Claim (10-20 min)</h2>
              <p class="body">Standard. Screens show flight numbers. Trolleys are free. There is a currency exchange counter near baggage claim but the rates are terrible; wait until you get to the city.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Get a SIM Card (5 min) OR Use Your eSIM</h2>
              <p class="body mb-2">After customs, before you exit into the arrivals hall, there is a China Unicom kiosk on your left.</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside body space-y-1">
                <li>China Unicom &#165;100 package: 20GB data + local number, valid 30 days</li>
                <li>You need your passport to register (mandatory in China)</li>
                <li>The staff at the airport kiosk speak basic English</li>
                <li>If you already activated an eSIM (Airalo/Nomad), skip this step</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="caption mt-2">Do this NOW. Once you leave the airport, getting a SIM as a foreigner is much harder (store visits, language barrier, passport registration takes 30+ min).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">4</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Set Up Alipay (5 min, do this at the airport WiFi)</h2>
              <p class="body mb-2">Connect to the free airport WiFi (no phone verification needed for this one). Open Alipay:</p>
              <ol class="list-decimal list-inside body space-y-1">
                <li>Tap Me Icon > Settings > Account & Security</li>
                <li>Verify identity with passport photo (takes 2-3 min)</li>
                <li>Go to Pay > Add Card > Link your Visa/Mastercard</li>
                <li>Test: try scanning a QR code or sending 1 yuan to yourself</li>
              </ol>
              <p class="caption mt-2">If Alipay verification fails (it sometimes does for new accounts), use cash for the first day and try again on hotel WiFi.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5 -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">5</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Get to Your Hotel (40-60 min)</h2>
              <p class="body mb-2">Three options. Use this exact order:</p>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="tag shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800">Best</span><div><p class="font-medium text-sm">Didi (Chinese Uber)</p><p class="caption">Open Alipay > Didi mini-app > enter hotel address. &#165;100-150, 45 min to city. Pay automatically via Alipay. No cash. No language barrier.</p></div></div>
                <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="tag shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800">OK</span><div><p class="font-medium text-sm">Metro Line 8</p><p class="caption">Follow signs downstairs. Trains every 8 min. &#165;7, 40 min to Qingdao North Station. Buy ticket at machine (English available). Runs 06:00-22:30.</p></div></div>
                <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="tag shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-red-100 text-red-800">Avoid</span><div><p class="font-medium text-sm">Street Taxis at Arrivals</p><p class="caption">Drivers will approach you before you reach the official taxi queue. They charge 2-3x the normal rate to tourists. Insist on Didi instead.</p></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 6 -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">6</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Hotel Check-In</h2>
              <p class="body mb-2">All Chinese hotels are required by law to register foreign guests with the police. This is normal.</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside body space-y-1">
                <li>Hand over your passport (they will scan and photocopy it)</li>
                <li>They may ask for your visa and entry stamp</li>
                <li>Ask for the hotel WiFi password (you will need your phone number to log in)</li>
                <li>Ask for the hotel address card in Chinese (for showing Didi drivers later)</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="caption mt-2">The police registration is automatic. You do not need to visit a police station. The hotel does it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick checklist -->
      <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 mb-10">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-4">Before You Leave Home Checklist</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 body">
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Install and test VPN on all devices</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Download Alipay and register account</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Download Google Translate + offline Chinese pack</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Screenshot hotel name + address in Chinese</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Photocopy passport + visa (keep separate from originals)</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Buy eSIM or plan to get airport SIM</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Write down hotel phone number (for Didi driver)</label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-subtle)]/30 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-[var(--color-accent)]" /> Pack pen for Arrival Card (not provided on all flights)</label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="/faq/" class="btn-outline">More FAQ</a>
        <a href="/qingdao-transportation/" class="btn-ghost">Transportation Guide</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
